
# Inventory Management System

A menu-driven Java JDBC application using MySQL.

## Features
- Insert product records
- Retrieve products by category and sort by price
- Update product stock
- Search products and modify prices
- Calculate inventory value
- Delete products only when stock is zero

## Technologies
- Java
- JDBC
- MySQL
- IntelliJ IDEA

## Database Setup
Create a database named `retail_db` and a table named `Product`.

## Configuration
Update the database URL, username, and password
in `InventoryManagement.java`.

Add the MySQL Connector/J JAR to the project's
Libraries in IntelliJ IDEA.

## Run
Run `InventoryManagement.java` from IntelliJ IDEA.

